    <div class="contact-links">
      <a href="https://github.com/vinithreddybanda" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><span class="eyebrow">01 / Code</span><strong>GitHub ↗</strong></a>
      <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><span class="eyebrow">02 / Network</span><strong>LinkedIn ↗</strong></a>
